# .claudeignore - Claude Code & Agent Context Ignore Rules
# 遵循 gitignore 語法，防止非必要的大型檔案、二進位模型、音訊與機密資訊消耗 Context Window

# 版本控制與 IDE 快取 (Version Control & IDE Caches)
.git/
.vscode/
.idea/
.pytest_cache/
.agents/

# 虛擬環境與 Python 快取 (Virtual Environments & Python Bytecode)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
venv/
.venv/
env/

# 機密與憑證資訊 (Secrets & Credentials)
.env
*.env
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
telegram_agent/.env

# 音訊與媒體測試檔案 (Audio & Media Files)
*.mp3
*.wav
*.ogg
*.flac
*.m4a
*.aac
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.webp

# 大型模型檔案、權重與備份 (Large Models & Backups)
raspi5_ollama_backup/
*.hef
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.onnx
models/blobs/
models/manifests/

# 資料庫、暫存與日誌檔案 (Databases, Temporary Files & Logs)
*.log
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
telegram_agent/data/
telegram_agent/temp/
*.tmp

# 本地草稿筆記 (Local Draft Notes)
note1.txt
plan1.md
plan2.md
